{"version":2,"width":104,"height":20,"timestamp":1791125957,"command":"bash scripts/record-demo.sh --session","title":"Specify: intent to readable contracts"}
[0.017034, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;36mSPECIFY\u001b[0m  Keep intent readable, with precise contracts underneath.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m sed -n 8,15p specify.spec/areas/overview.yaml\r\n"]
[0.728536, "o", "  - id: no-args-returns-json-manifest\r\n    title: Agent-readable command discovery\r\n    rationale:\r\n      A structured manifest lets agents discover supported commands and global options predictably\r\n      without parsing prose or guessing.\r\n    description: >-\r\n      Running with no arguments exits 0 and outputs JSON with commands, global options, and exit\r\n      codes.\r\n"]
[7.737704, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;36mSPECIFY\u001b[0m  Give agents the same capture / review / reconcile workflow.\r\n\r\n"]
[7.737717, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m specify spec init --spec specify.spec\r\n"]
[8.53758, "o", "{\r\n  \"path\": \"/private/tmp/specify-demo.KDQ0Jf/AGENTS.md\",\r\n  \"spec\": \"/private/tmp/specify-demo.KDQ0Jf/specify.spec\",\r\n  \"initialized\": true\r\n}\r\n"]
[13.547413, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;36mSPECIFY\u001b[0m  Check structure. Project tests still check application behavior.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m specify spec lint --spec specify.spec\r\n"]
[14.34364, "o", "\u001b[1;32m✓ Spec is valid\u001b[0m"]
[14.343713, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.354758, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;36mSPECIFY\u001b[0m  Open the bundled reader in any project.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m specify view --no-open\r\n"]
